 pendence of Israel in 1948. Although Yom HaAtzma'ut is normally observed o
 n the 5th of Iyyar\, it may be moved earlier or postponed if observance of
  the holiday (or Yom HaZikaron\, which always precedes it) would conflict 
 with Shabbat
END:VEVENT
